Portions of this project are derived from ExcelJS
(https://github.com/exceljs/exceljs), Copyright (c) 2014-2024 Guyon Roche,
licensed under the MIT License.

Specifically, the following were adapted:
  - column/address helpers (A1 <-> {row, col}, column-letter maths)
  - date <-> Excel serial-number conversion, including the 1900 leap-year
    quirk handling
  - the table of built-in number-format ids

The OOXML part templates in ExcelJS's `lib/xlsx/xform/**` were used as
reference for the shape of the generated XML; the serialisers here are an
independent, leaner implementation.

